OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry start rain will
OL,6,Fsoon spread east through the morning.
OL,7,FRain turning light and patchy by
OL,8,Fduring the afternoon and clearing the
OL,9,Fisles by late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FWet and windy at first but
OL,12,Frain turning to showers with some
OL,13,Fclear conditions too. Continuing
OL,14,Fshowery overnight with a stiff
OL,15,Fwesterly wind moving the showers
OL,16,Fthrough.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA blustery day with showers
OL,19,Fand strong, gusty winds, perhaps some
OL,20,Fshelter up for Ayrshire with less
OL,21,Fshowers here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
